(text "GOODJOHN / CPC464 USB KEYBOARD CARRIER" (at 25.4 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e26b7d1c-0d6d-5626-962a-9f2512bc5495"))
(text "USB KEYBOARD ONLY - DISCONNECT CPC MOTHERBOARD, EVEN WHEN POWERED OFF." (at 25.4 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3f83333b-e3b7-52ae-8148-41acc1947961"))
(text "Use J1 OR J2 + J3 for one keyboard. No CPC pass-through; no keyboard supply connection." (at 25.4 36.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6cd06465-dbec-52e3-bdcb-c018173a2189"))
(text "U1: original RP2040 Pico / Pico H on two 1x20 sockets.\nPC USB data cable supplies power via the Pico USB socket.\nOnly GND is used on the carrier; VBUS / VSYS / 3V3 stay isolated.\nGP2..GP11 scan Y1..Y10; GP12..GP20 sense X1..X9.\nUnselected rows are inputs; X inputs use Pico pull-ups." (at 25.4 148.59 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8c38f82f-bfa8-50e2-ae54-f9ccae81b324"))
(text "J1: INLINE 19 CONTACTS\nrgbwalker V1.2 / Bread80 J3 / original PCB-style CPC464\nContact 1 = X9; optional keyboard contact 20 stays unused." (at 132.08 52.07 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ec4d1b2c-d8a0-53b5-9b21-04f201ff6038"))
(text "BREAD80 CPC464 SMT J1\nJ2 = A, odd keyboard pads 1..19\nJ3 = B, even keyboard pads 2..20" (at 208.28 48.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b91b4887-f5f7-531b-9c76-a18e30924dae"))
(text "A10 / keyboard J1.19 is NC.\nB10 / keyboard J1.20 is Y1.\nLK1: 1-2; LK2: 1-2; LK3 open.\nBonus links open." (at 208.28 96.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6c1f225d-4523-5350-a5e2-6b56fbb838d2"))
(text "H1..H4: 3.2mm unplated holes for M3 standoffs.\nAll keyboard contacts are signals: never attach power or GND.\nPrototype: electrical/design checks do not replace bench testing." (at 25.4 176.53 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3300d049-7813-5072-a1bb-6f45bda30eeb"))
(embedded_fonts no))
